            "updated_at": "2025-04-30T12:30:51.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p>Kamera ostida qizil chiroqdan o‘tib ketish va to‘xtash liniyasidan o‘tib ketish &nbsp;uchun jarima</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "null",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 95,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T16:24:49.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2025-04-30T12:35:52.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>\"Белбоғ\" учун жарима</strong></p><p>Ҳайдовчилар томонидан транспорт воситаларини бошқаришда ва йўловчиларни ташишда хавфсизлик камарларидан фойдаланиш қоидаларига риоя қилмаслик, шунингдек, мотоцикл ҳайдовчилари томонидан мотоцикл дубулғаларидан фойдаланиш қоидаларига риоя қилмаслик.</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "125-1",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 96,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T16:25:52.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2025-04-30T12:34:04.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>\"Belbog‘\" uchun jarima</strong></p><p>Haydovchilar tomonidan transport vositalarini boshqarishda va yo‘lovchilarni tashishda xavfsizlik kamarlaridan foydalanish qoidalariga rioya qilmaslik, shuningdek, mototsikl haydovchilari tomonidan mototsikl dubulg‘alaridan foydalanish qoidalariga rioya qilmaslik.</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "125-1",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 99,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T16:51:48.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T16:52:09.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>\"Yukning ortib ketishi\", \"piyoda\" yoki markalash talablarini buzish uchun jarima</strong><br>Haydovchilarning piyodalar yo'laklarida harakatlanishi, yo'l belgilari va boshqa yo'l harakati qoidalari talablariga rioya qilmaslik.&nbsp;</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "128",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 101,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T17:07:19.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2025-04-30T12:37:09.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Техник кўрик, биринчи тиббий ёрдам тўплами, ўт ўчириш мосламаси, огоҳлантириш белги</strong></p><p>Белгиланган тартибда рўйхатдан ўтмаган ёки мажбурий техник кўрикдан ўтмаган ёки &nbsp;ўт ўчириш мосламаси, биринчи тиббий ёрдам тўплами, огоҳлантирувчи белги ва рефлектор жилет билан жиҳозланмаган транспорт воситаларини бошқараётган ҳайдовчилар[...]</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "125-2",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 102,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T17:08:24.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2025-04-30T12:36:40.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Texnik ko‘rik, birinchi tibbiy yordam to‘plami, o‘t o‘chirish moslamasi, ogohlantirish belgi</strong></p><p>Belgilangan tartibda ro‘yxatdan o‘tmagan yoki majburiy texnik ko‘rikdan o‘tmagan yoki &nbsp;o‘t o‘chirish moslamasi, birinchi tibbiy yordam to‘plami, ogohlantiruvchi belgi va reflektor jilet bilan jihozlanmagan transport vositalarini boshqarayotgan haydovchilar[...]</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "null",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 105,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T17:12:08.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T17:12:08.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>20 km/soat tezlikka erishish uchun jarima</strong></p><p>Belgilangan tezlikni soatiga 20 kilometrdan ortiq bo'lmagan transport vositalarining haydovchilari.</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": null,
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 108,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T19:14:40.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T19:14:40.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Tezlikni soatiga 20 dan 40 km gacha oshirish uchun jarima</strong></p><p>Belgilangan tezlikdan 20 dan ortiq, lekin soatiga 40 kilometrdan ortiq bo'lmagan transport vositalarining haydovchilari</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "128-3-2",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 111,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T19:20:50.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T19:20:50.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>40 km/soatdan yuqori tezlikda harakatlanish uchun jarima</strong></p><p>Belgilangan tezlikni soatiga 40 kilometrdan ortiq oshirgan transport vositalarining haydovchilari.</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "128-3-3",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 115,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T19:40:52.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T19:40:52.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Mumkinmas bo`lgan joyda to'xtash uchun jarima</strong></p><p>Haydovchilar tomonidan transport vositalarining to'xtash yoki to'xtash qoidalarini buzishi.</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "128-6-1",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 118,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T20:58:43.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T20:58:56.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Qoraytirilgan oynalar</strong></p><p>Davlat standarti normalariga muvofiq bo‘lmagan ko‘zgusimon yoki tusi o‘zgartirilgan (qoraytirilgan) oynali transport vositalaridan, xuddi shuningdek haydovchining o‘rnidan tevarak-atrofni ko‘rishni cheklaydigan qo‘shimcha narsalar o‘rnatilgan yoki qoplamalar surtilgan transport vositalaridan foydalanish</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "126-1-1",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 120,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T21:47:42.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2025-04-30T12:33:03.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Камера остида қизил чироқдан ўтиб кетиш ва тўхташ линиясидан ўтиб кетиш &nbsp;учун жарима</strong><br>Автотранспорт воситалари ҳайдовчиларининг тақиқловчи светофорга ёки светофорнинг тақиқловчи ишорасига ўтиши.</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "null",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 123,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T22:13:27.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T22:13:27.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Transport vositasidan foydalanish vakti uyali telefon vositasidan foydalanganligi va gaplashgani uchun jarima</strong><br><br>Xaydovchi rulda otirgan payt telefondan foydalangani uchun</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": null,
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 126,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T22:30:26.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T22:30:39.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Hujjatsiz haydash uchun jarima</strong></p><p>Yoʻl harakati qoidalarida nazarda tutilgan hujjatlari (haydovchilik guvohnomasi, roʻyxatdan oʻtganlik guvohnomasi, ishonchnoma, sugʻurta polisi va boshqalar) boʻlmagan haydovchilar tomonidan transport vositalarini boshqarish</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
            "article": "null",
            "article_part": null,
            "for_public_transport": 0
        },
        {
            "id": 129,
            "created_at": "2022-02-02T22:34:01.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2022-02-02T22:34:01.000000Z",
            "created_by": 2360,
            "updated_by": 2360,
            "body": "<p><strong>Sug'urtasiz</strong></p><p>Avtotransport vositalari egalarining fuqarolik javobgarligini majburiy sug'urta qilish bo'yicha qonun hujjatlarida belgilangan majburiyatni bajarmasliklari, shuningdek, agar bunday majburiy sug'urta mavjud emasligi ma'lum bo'lsa, transport vositalarini boshqarish</p>",
            "parent_id": null,
            "for_cars": 1,
            "for_truck": 0,
            "for_motorcycle": 0,
            "lang_id": 1,
            "penalty_category_id": 1,
